        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drowning_Creek%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mixed hardwood forests, including oak-hickory woodlands and shortleaf pine, cover much of the surrounding Ozark Plateau.",
